/*
 * Implements semantic validation for unit test blocks.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of unittest bodies,
 *   - enforcement of void return type,
 *   - block-scope management for local variables,
 *   - error aggregation and propagation,
 *   - construction of UnitTestGenerator entries,
 *   - generation of unique test paths based on module index.
 *
 * Unittests are validated similarly to functions, but with simplified
 * semantics: they always return void, cannot declare parameters, and cannot
 * specify attributes or throwers.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::unittest
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/unittest.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-24
